<a class="skip-link" href="#calculator">跳到换算器</a>

<div class="world" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="cloud cloud-one"></div>
  <div class="cloud cloud-two"></div>
  <div class="floating-block block-one"></div>
  <div class="floating-block block-two"></div>
  <div class="ground-line"></div>
</div>

<header class="site-header">
  <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Base Money 首页">
    <span class="brand-cube" aria-hidden="true"><span>¥</span></span>
    <span class="brand-copy">
      <strong>BASE MONEY</strong>
      <small>你的本位币换算器</small>
    </span>
  </a>

  <button class="pixel-button settings-trigger" id="open-settings" type="button">
    <span class="gear" aria-hidden="true">⚙</span>
    <span>设置</span>
  </button>
</header>

<main id="calculator" tabindex="-1">
  <section class="intro" aria-labelledby="page-title">
    <p class="eyebrow"><span aria-hidden="true">◆</span> PERSONAL CURRENCY CONVERTER</p>
    <h1 id="page-title">看心里有数的价格</h1>
    <p class="intro-copy">输入一次，最多同时查看五种本位币。你的偏好只留在这台设备上。</p>
  </section>

  <section class="workbench" aria-label="汇率换算器">
    <div class="bench-top" aria-hidden="true">
      <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>
    </div>

    <div class="input-panel">
      <div class="panel-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="panel-kicker">AMOUNT TO CONVERT</p>
          <h2>你看见的价格</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="torch" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div>
      </div>

      <form id="amount-form" action="/" method="get" novalidate>
        <fieldset>
          <legend class="visually-hidden">输入待换算的金额和币种</legend>

          <div class="amount-field">
            <label for="amount">金额</label>
            <p class="field-hint" id="amount-hint">可使用小数点或小数逗号，不需要输入货币符号。</p>
            <div class="amount-control">
              <span class="prompt" aria-hidden="true">›</span>
              <input
                id="amount"
                name="amount"
                type="text"
                inputmode="decimal"
                enterkeyhint="done"
                autocomplete="off"
                value="100"
                aria-describedby="amount-hint amount-error"
              />
              <button class="clear-button" id="clear-amount" type="button" aria-label="清空金额">清空</button>
            </div>
            <p class="field-error" id="amount-error" aria-live="polite"></p>
          </div>

          <div class="currency-field">
            <label for="input-currency">
              <span class="wide-label">这次使用的币种</span>
              <span class="mobile-label">输入币种</span>
            </label>
            <div class="select-shell">
              <select id="input-currency" name="currency" aria-describedby="currency-hint">
                <option value="USD">USD — 美元</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <p class="field-hint" id="currency-hint">在设置里可以修改下次打开时的默认币种。</p>
          </div>
        </fieldset>
      </form>

      <div class="sync-strip">
        <span class="signal" id="sync-signal" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <div>
          <strong id="sync-status" aria-live="polite">正在同步汇率…</strong>
          <small id="rate-freshness">首次加载需要连接网络</small>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="error-panel" id="rates-error" hidden>
        <span aria-hidden="true">!</span>
        <p>暂时无法获取汇率。金额会保留，你可以稍后重试。</p>
        <button class="pixel-button compact" id="retry-rates" type="button">重新同步</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="result-panel">
      <div class="panel-heading result-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="panel-kicker">YOUR BASE CURRENCIES</p>
          <h2>换算结果</h2>
        </div>
        <span class="mini-map" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></span>
      </div>

      <ul class="result-list" id="result-list" role="list">
        <li class="result-card is-loading">
          <span class="result-code">CNY</span>
          <strong class="result-value">—</strong>
          <small>等待汇率同步</small>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <div class="formula-note">
        <span aria-hidden="true">÷</span>
        <p><strong>交叉汇率换算</strong><br />所有币种先换算为 USD 基准，再换算到你的本位币。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <p class="source-note">
    汇率由 <a href="https://www.exchangerate-api.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">ExchangeRate-API</a> 提供 · 每小时更新 · 仅供估算
  </p>
</main>

<dialog class="settings-dialog" id="settings-dialog" aria-labelledby="settings-title">
  <div class="dialog-edge" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="dialog-header">
    <div>
      <p class="panel-kicker">CURRENCY PREFERENCES</p>
      <h2 id="settings-title">默认币种设置</h2>
    </div>
    <button class="icon-button" id="close-settings" type="button" aria-label="关闭设置">×</button>
  </div>

  <form id="settings-form">
    <div class="settings-scroll">
      <div class="settings-section">
        <label for="default-input-currency">默认输入币种</label>
        <div class="select-shell">
          <select id="default-input-currency" name="defaultInputCurrency">
            <option value="USD">USD — 美元</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>

      <fieldset class="settings-section target-fieldset">
        <legend>本位币</legend>
        <div class="target-tools">
          <div>
            <label for="currency-search">搜索币种</label>
            <input id="currency-search" type="search" placeholder="例如 JPY 或 日元" autocomplete="off" />
          </div>
          <output id="selection-count" for="target-currency-list">0 / 5</output>
        </div>
        <p class="field-hint" id="target-hint">最多选择 5 个；一个都不选时仍会显示 CNY。</p>
        <div
          class="currency-choice-list"
          id="target-currency-list"
          aria-describedby="target-hint target-limit-message"
        ></div>
        <p class="limit-message" id="target-limit-message" aria-live="polite"></p>
      </fieldset>
    </div>

    <div class="dialog-actions">
      <button class="text-button" id="reset-settings" type="button">恢复默认</button>
      <div>
        <button class="pixel-button muted" id="cancel-settings" type="button">取消</button>
        <button class="pixel-button save" id="save-settings" type="submit">保存设置</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </form>
</dialog>

<script>
  import "../scripts/calculator";
</script>
